sf-power-a-seraph-name = Spear of First Light
sf-power-a-seraph-description = After 3s, deals 15000 damage to enemy units and 25000 to buildings within 4 cells. Requires explored terrain; losing the installation, power or ownership during the warning cancels the strike. Recharge: 240s.
sf-ultimate-a-seraph-name = Spear of First Light Array
sf-ultimate-a-seraph-description = Seraphic Synod superweapon installation. Requires power; visible charge timer. One per player.
sf-a-luminary-name = Luminary
sf-a-luminary-description = Long-range seven-cell light artillery in an infantry body; needs a screen and three seconds stationary for focused volleys.
sf-power-a-warden-name = The Unbroken Gate
sf-power-a-warden-description = After 3s, allies within 6 cells take 65% less damage and regenerate 2% HP per second for 15s. Requires explored terrain; losing the installation, power or ownership during the warning cancels the strike. Recharge: 210s.
sf-ultimate-a-warden-name = The Unbroken Gate Array
sf-ultimate-a-warden-description = Order of the Gate superweapon installation. Requires power; visible charge timer. One per player.
sf-a-wardbearer-name = Wardbearer
sf-a-wardbearer-description = Infantry shield relay. Projects the same four-cell non-stacking formation protection as a Gatekeeper.
sf-power-a-exile-name = Heaven in Revolt
sf-power-a-exile-description = After 3s, allied units within 6 cells gain 40% firepower and 50% speed for 20s, but take 20% more damage. Requires explored terrain; losing the installation, power or ownership during the warning cancels the strike. Recharge: 180s.
sf-ultimate-a-exile-name = Heaven in Revolt Array
sf-ultimate-a-exile-description = The Unshackled superweapon installation. Requires power; visible charge timer. One per player.
sf-a-outrider-name = Exile Outrider
sf-a-outrider-description = Fast, lightly protected attack chassis. At low health Defiance improves speed and damage; kite rather than trade with heavy armor.
sf-power-a-desolation-name = Requiem for the Living
sf-power-a-desolation-description = After 3s, allied troops within 6 cells gain 45% firepower for 20s; enemy infantry are weakened and slowed for 12s. Requires explored terrain; losing the installation, power or ownership during the warning cancels the strike. Recharge: 240s.
sf-ultimate-a-desolation-name = Requiem for the Living Array
sf-ultimate-a-desolation-description = Choir of Desolation superweapon installation. Requires power; visible charge timer. One per player.
sf-power-h-bastion-name = Rolling Thunder
sf-power-h-bastion-description = After 3s, three eastward-moving impacts at 1s intervals deal 9000 unit / 18000 building damage in 3-cell circles. Requires explored terrain; losing the installation, power or ownership during the warning cancels the strike. Recharge: 240s.
sf-ultimate-h-bastion-name = Rolling Thunder Array
sf-ultimate-h-bastion-description = Bastion Directorate superweapon installation. Requires power; visible charge timer. One per player.
sf-h-sapper-name = Bastion Sapper
sf-h-sapper-description = Short-range breaching rocket specialist. Strong against concrete; fragile during the approach.
sf-power-h-union-name = Emergency Airlift
sf-power-h-union-description = After 3s, repairs allied units by 30% maximum HP and grants 30% speed for 20s within 7 cells. Requires explored terrain; losing the installation, power or ownership during the warning cancels the strike. Recharge: 150s.
sf-ultimate-h-union-name = Emergency Airlift Array
sf-ultimate-h-union-description = Free Earth Union superweapon installation. Requires power; visible charge timer. One per player.
sf-h-pathfinder-name = Pathfinder
sf-h-pathfinder-description = Fast reconnaissance vehicle and six-cell mobile supply relay. Nearby allies move and reload faster.
sf-power-h-covenant-name = Ashes to Ashes
sf-power-h-covenant-description = After 3s, fully heals allied infantry and reduces incoming damage by 80% for 12s within 6 cells. Requires explored terrain; losing the installation, power or ownership during the warning cancels the strike. Recharge: 210s.
sf-ultimate-h-covenant-name = Ashes to Ashes Array
sf-ultimate-h-covenant-description = Ashen Covenant superweapon installation. Requires power; visible charge timer. One per player.
sf-h-confessor-name = Ash Confessor
sf-h-confessor-description = Lightly armed battlefield medic. Projects a four-cell healing and protection oath for infantry.
sf-power-h-area52-name = Project Event Horizon
sf-power-h-area52-description = After 3s, deals 12000 damage to enemies, locks all nearby troops for 6s, and nullifies supernatural abilities for 30s. Affects friendly troops too. Radius 5. Requires explored terrain; losing the installation, power or ownership during the warning cancels the strike. Recharge: 270s.
sf-ultimate-h-area52-name = Project Event Horizon Array
sf-ultimate-h-area52-description = Area Fifty Two superweapon installation. Requires power; visible charge timer. One per player.
sf-power-d-legion-name = The Ninth Furnace
sf-power-d-legion-description = After 3s, deals 65000 damage to enemy buildings and 10000 to troops within 4 cells; survivors move at 40% speed for 10s. Requires explored terrain; losing the installation, power or ownership during the warning cancels the strike. Recharge: 270s.
sf-ultimate-d-legion-name = The Ninth Furnace Array
sf-ultimate-d-legion-description = Iron Legions superweapon installation. Requires power; visible charge timer. One per player.
sf-d-taskmaster-name = Iron Taskmaster
sf-d-taskmaster-description = Armored command infantry. Projects a four-cell siege formation that trades movement speed for protection.
sf-power-d-brood-name = The Red Deluge
sf-power-d-brood-description = After 3s, allied infantry within 7 cells heal 25% HP, regenerate 2% HP/sec and attack 35% faster for 30s. Requires explored terrain; losing the installation, power or ownership during the warning cancels the strike. Recharge: 180s.
sf-ultimate-d-brood-name = The Red Deluge Array
sf-ultimate-d-brood-description = Blood Brood superweapon installation. Requires power; visible charge timer. One per player.
sf-d-goremaw-name = Goremaw
sf-d-goremaw-description = Heavy melee predator. Enemy troop kills restore health and accelerate its next hunt; vulnerable to kiting.
sf-power-d-court-name = The Nameless Silence
sf-power-d-court-description = After 3s, enemy units and defenses within 5 cells deal no weapon damage and troops cannot move for 12s. Does not disable superweapon charging. Requires explored terrain; losing the installation, power or ownership during the warning cancels the strike. Recharge: 240s.
sf-ultimate-d-court-name = The Nameless Silence Array
sf-ultimate-d-court-description = Court of Whispers superweapon installation. Requires power; visible charge timer. One per player.
sf-d-silencer-name = Silencer
sf-d-silencer-description = Fragile seven-cell curse specialist. Its attacks slow and weaken a victim, enabling the rest of the army to close.
sf-power-d-contempt-name = The Final Verdict
sf-power-d-contempt-description = After 3s, enemy units below half HP suffer 25000 damage; others take 8000, buildings 15000. Nearby allies gain 45% firepower for 12s. Radius 5. Requires explored terrain; losing the installation, power or ownership during the warning cancels the strike. Recharge: 240s.
sf-ultimate-d-contempt-name = The Final Verdict Array
sf-ultimate-d-contempt-description = Circle of Contempt superweapon installation. Requires power; visible charge timer. One per player.
